{"schema":"asx.scenario.v2","id":"sync-notify-one-then-all-leaves-nothing-stored-001","description":"Three waiters park, arriving at 10, 20 and 30. In one poll t.sig calls notify_one (it selects t.w1, the longest parked) and then notify_all (it wakes t.w2 and t.w3): all three pass at 100, in the order the lab dispatches the woken tasks, and the pair leaves no notification stored, because notify_one found a waiter. t.w4, which starts waiting at 200, therefore parks until t.sig's final notify_one at 400.","unit":"sync","rules":["inv.determinism.replayable"],"seed":42,"lab":{"max_steps":1000},"regions":[{"name":"r.main","parent":"root","budget":null}],"channels":[],"sync":[{"name":"n","type":"notify"}],"tasks":[{"name":"t.w1","region":"r.main","budget":null,"program":[{"op":"sleep","ns":10},{"op":"notify_wait","notify":"n"},{"op":"trace","message":"w1 passed"}]},{"name":"t.w2","region":"r.main","budget":null,"program":[{"op":"sleep","ns":20},{"op":"notify_wait","notify":"n"},{"op":"trace","message":"w2 passed"}]},{"name":"t.w3","region":"r.main","budget":null,"program":[{"op":"sleep","ns":30},{"op":"notify_wait","notify":"n"},{"op":"trace","message":"w3 passed"}]},{"name":"t.w4","region":"r.main","budget":null,"program":[{"op":"sleep","ns":200},{"op":"trace","message":"w4 waits"},{"op":"notify_wait","notify":"n"},{"op":"trace","message":"w4 passed"}]},{"name":"t.sig","region":"r.main","budget":null,"program":[{"op":"sleep","ns":100},{"op":"notify_one","notify":"n"},{"op":"notify_all","notify":"n"},{"op":"sleep","ns":300},{"op":"trace","message":"final signal"},{"op":"notify_one","notify":"n"}]}],"script":[],"expect":{"kind":"ok"}}
